<h2>You've been invited to <%= @organization.name %></h2>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p><strong><%= @inviter.name %></strong> has invited you to join <strong><%= @organization.name %></strong> on Netra.</p>

<p>Sign in with your temporary credentials:</p>

<table style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 4px 12px 4px 0; color: #666;">Email:</td>
    <td style="padding: 4px 0;"><%= @user.email %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 4px 12px 4px 0; color: #666;">Password:</td>
    <td style="padding: 4px 0;"><%= @temp_password %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p><a href="<%= @login_url %>">Sign in to Netra</a></p>

<p>Please change your password after signing in.</p>

<p>— Netra</p>
